## Historical mechanisms actually charged

The desk supplies the exact pinned formulas and itemized reading extents:
P133 is `gcd(N,(N/d)phi(d))`, EGD is `gcd(d,phi(d))`, and APD is the
Fermat-quotient operator `((x-x^p)/p) mod p`. These are not ADG or LPG.
Same carrier and the overloaded word “derivative” do not establish identity.

FSD and FID are precisely `Max composed with SX` and `Max composed with DI`
on the antichain input subcarrier. The main author also read the complete
current `graph_relation/PROOF_PACKAGE.md` and `SOURCE_AND_COLLISION.md`:
DI's decreasing maximal-layer argument survives here and is fully deducted;
SX's two additive witnesses can be lost under maximalization, so its
first-image inclusion theorem is not transferred without proof. The old
MPU text leaves its diagonal convention unspecified: complement duality
is conditional, not an established exact historical time conjugacy.

USS/WCF face P04's compositional reversion, ELD's triangular inversion,
and AA08's continued-fraction quotient deletion. None is claimed to be
the identical map; all of those reusable primitives receive zero new
credit. WCF's precision contraction and forgotten top coefficient already
settle its proposed axes at a generic level, even without a literal hit.

The main author read the complete root exclusion desk and the old
`docs/papers197_201_sequence/scouting/algebra_lane/COLLISION_MEMO.md`, as well
as the first 135 lines of ninth-lane `PROOF_AND_ADAPTER_NOTES.md` including
the complete ELD and VDF parts. Preliminary ELD, self-displacement SDD
and longest-palindromic-suffix PS suggestions were removed before the six
frozen rows. The root exclusion desk is recovery/context evidence, not
a substitute proof of those old mechanisms. No old pilot was executed.

## Pre-execution assessment

LPG is the old squarefree coprimality constant control. FID is old layer
erosion. USS is a triangular bijection with singleton fibres. WCF is an
exact generic precision shift with uniform nonempty fibres. None receives
a numerical pilot or independent-paper credit. Their deductions are
spelled out in `INTAKE.md` and will be bounded in the final proof note.

ADG has only an adjacent-support exclusion and a classical congruence
encoding, not an all-parameter cycle/clock or evaluated fibre extremum.
FSD has only a restricted old sumset operation plus maximalization, not
an established rigid time mechanism or evaluated all-target inverse.
Only these two are sent to the immutable complete boxes in `INTAKE.md`.
Finite success would still not establish either missing theorem axis.
